&lt;p&gt;For all inquiries — general, speakers, CFP, or sponsorship:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FAQ</title><link>https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/faq/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/faq/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="frequently-asked-questions"&gt;Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-list"&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;When and where is CND Poland 2026?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
CND Poland 2026 takes place on &lt;strong&gt;October 22, 2026&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Varso Tower&lt;/strong&gt;, Chmielna 69, 00-801 Warsaw. See the &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/#venue"&gt;Venue section&lt;/a&gt; for the full address, map, and how to get there.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;How do I get to the venue?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
Varso Tower is in the heart of Warsaw and easy to reach. &lt;strong&gt;Warszawa Centralna&lt;/strong&gt; railway station is a 2-minute walk away, and the &lt;strong&gt;Rondo ONZ&lt;/strong&gt; metro station (M2 line) is right next to the venue. &lt;strong&gt;Warsaw Chopin Airport (WAW)&lt;/strong&gt; is about 10 km from the city centre, and paid parking is available in the Varso Tower garage. See the &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/#venue"&gt;Venue section&lt;/a&gt; for a map and directions.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;How much does a ticket cost?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
Tickets are on sale now, with early-bird pricing available for a limited time. Current prices are listed on our &lt;a href="https://cnd2026.konfeo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;ticket page&lt;/a&gt; — grab the early-bird rate before it's gone.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Is there a virtual attendance option?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
We are focused on an in-person experience. Sessions may be recorded and published after the event.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Can I submit a talk?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
The Call for Papers closed on &lt;strong&gt;June 1, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;, so submissions are no longer being accepted. Thank you to everyone who proposed a talk! Our program committee is now reviewing submissions, and selected speakers will be notified by email. See the &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/#cfp"&gt;CFP section&lt;/a&gt; for what happens next.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;How can I become a sponsor?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
We'd love to hear from you. Download our &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/cnd-poland-2026-prospectus.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;2026 sponsorship prospectus (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;, head to the &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/#contact"&gt;Contact section&lt;/a&gt;, or email us at &lt;a href="mailto:organizers@cloudnativedayspoland.org"&gt;organizers@cloudnativedayspoland.org&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Is there a Code of Conduct?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
Yes. Please read our &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/code-of-conduct/"&gt;Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;. We are committed to providing a safe and welcoming environment for everyone.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Where can I find the legal documents?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
You can review our &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/privacy-pol.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Privacy Policy (PDF)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class="faq-en" href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/privacy-eng.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;(English)&lt;/a&gt;, our &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/terms-of-service-pol.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Conference Terms of Service (PDF)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class="faq-en" href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/terms-of-service-eng.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;(English)&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/regulations-electronic-services-pol.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Regulations for the Provision of Electronic Services (PDF)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class="faq-en" href="https://cnd-poland.github.io/2026-webpage-pages-preview/files/regulations/regulations-electronic-services-eng.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;(English)&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details class="faq-item" open&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Will there be food and drinks?&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="faq-answer"&gt;
Yes, lunch and refreshments will be provided for all attendees, plus great coffee throughout the day and an after-party to keep the community spirit going.
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>